  clock: 6  # 6f12
  nonce: 6f12  # 6f12
  message: "Completed by L3 (PR merged as 0acdb6400e on selfh/dev). The orchestrator joins that let any exception escaping a pass abort the whole run are now contained: analyze/all_analyzers.run_all_analyzers (threaded), linkers/registry.run_all_linkers (serial + parallel), and the linker enclosure post-pass. A crashed pass is recorded pass-level via Limits.record_crashed_pass() -> skipped_passes ('crashed: <ExcType>: ...') + partial_results_reason (no-clobber). L1/L2 (per-file read + fingerprint pre-pass) shipped earlier in fa62411499. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE: (1) live filed-repro re-run through the CLI as non-root — chmod-000 b.py in a 2-file repo: 'hypergumbo run --out' (L1) exits 0 with valid JSON (1 node, failed_files=[{analyzer:python, path:b.py, reason:PermissionError ... Permission denied}]); default 'hypergumbo run' (L2 fingerprint path) exits 0 and writes results.json. (2) production-path test test_run_behavior_map_emits_partial_json_when_analyzer_crashes (a crashing registered analyzer -> valid partial JSON on disk + 'crashed:' skipped_passes entry) covers L3. Out of scope (analogues, not run-path 17 sites): test-only serial run_all_analyzers in analyze/registry.py; ranking.py centrality worker (self-guards OSError)."  # 6f12
